1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,400
I recently handled a case

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,540
about toxic managers and employees.

3
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:06,000
I'll tell you about it.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,520
I am Dr. Hyma Prasad, Psychologist.

5
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,160
A boy I know,

6
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:14,880
very smart at a young age,

7
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,580
landed a great MNC job.

8
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:21,000
While working his job,

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,960
the people around him

10
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,780
were quite senior in age.

11
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:29,500
As he performed well

12
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,720
and continued his work,

13
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:35,740
his salary kept getting hiked.

14
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,940
Compared to them,

15
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:40,500
he earned twice as much.

16
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,180
They grew jealous of him

17
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:44,520
and constantly criticized him.

18
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:47,460
Right to his face,

19
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:50,180
they used vulgar language

20
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:52,880
and hurled abuses at him.

21
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:55,760
Because of this,

22
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:58,260
he slipped into deep depression.

23
00:00:58,260 --> 00:01:00,160
Then, he came to me.

24
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:03,540
When we analyzed why

25
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:05,980
he ended up like this,

26
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:08,960
the surrounding work environment

27
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:11,360
had a massive effect on him.

28
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:13,960
He wanted to work happily,

29
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:16,220
was a knowledgeable person,

30
00:01:16,220 --> 00:01:18,440
and friendly with everyone.

31
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:21,620
Yet their intention to oust him

32
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:24,180
deeply impacted his life.

33
00:01:24,180 --> 00:01:27,160
It left a severe mark.

